\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Student answer prediction erformance comapring VarFA to SPARFA-M on Assistment, Algebra and Bridge data sets. $\uparrow $ and $\downarrow $ denote higher and lower is better, respectively. VarFA performs better than SPARFA-M on all three data sets and evaluation metrics most of the time. Additionally, VarFA's run time is very close to SPARFA-M.}}{95}{table.caption.62}%
